/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*   int nc
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*     (Returned) Total number of coordinate vectors in the coordinate array
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*     being the product K_1 * K_2 * ... * K_M (see tabprm::K).
--
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h:*     (Returned) Pointer to the first element of a vector of length tabprm::M
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*     whose elements indicate whether the corresponding indexing vector is
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*     monotonic increasing (+1), or decreasing (-1).
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*   int *p0
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h:*     (Returned) Pointer to the first element of a vector of length tabprm::M
