/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*   double *delta
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h:*     (Returned) Pointer to the first element of a vector of length tabprm::M
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*     of interpolated indices into the coordinate array such that Upsilon_m,
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*     as defined in Paper III, is equal to (tabprm::p0[m] + 1) + delta[m].
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*   double *extrema
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h:*     (Returned) Pointer to the first element of an array that records the
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*     minimum and maximum value of each element of the coordinate vector in
