/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-=       double extrema[K_M]...[K_2][2][M]
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h:*     (see tabprm::K).  The minimum is recorded in the first element of the
