/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*   struct wcserr *err
/testbed/cextern/wcslib/C/tab.h-*     (Returned) If enabled, when an error status is returned, this struct
