/testbed/docs/table/construct_table.rst:There is a slightly subtle issue that is important to understand about the way
/testbed/docs/table/construct_table.rst-that |Table| objects are created. Any data input that looks like a Python
/testbed/docs/table/construct_table.rst-:class:`list` (including a :class:`tuple`) is considered to be a list of
